{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The deeper you go into the <strong>Haunted Swamp</strong>, the more you feel Witch Maeve\u2019s influence. <strong>She has bent the creatures here to her will</strong>, turning them into <strong>cursed abominations</strong>. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>If you want to break free, you\u2019ll have to defeat her first...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/e3b5a0342f4ff3f5f50cbb5c9a26cfe6.avif?t=1756554999\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/c42d6c5ceee7960e165cdde3e6fa8d22.poster.avif?t=1756554999\" width=1170 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/c42d6c5ceee7960e165cdde3e6fa8d22.webm?t=1756554999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/c42d6c5ceee7960e165cdde3e6fa8d22.mp4?t=1756554999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Umigame</i>, you are a battle-hardened sea turtle on a perilous mission\u2014<strong>defeat the witch Maeve</strong> and free the Haunted Swamp from her curse. Fight through relentless enemies, adapt to ever-changing challenges, and grow stronger with every run in this fast-paced roguelite.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/ae291c6d9a5eaed6093a656b9c273bdc.avif?t=1756554999\" width=616 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/14d343c4bc2224475397bf4bb512fc0a.poster.avif?t=1756554999\" width=1170 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/14d343c4bc2224475397bf4bb512fc0a.webm?t=1756554999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/14d343c4bc2224475397bf4bb512fc0a.mp4?t=1756554999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is falling apart, but the <strong>Omnicore</strong> may be the key to saving it. This mysterious artifact fuels your abilities, letting you <strong>awaken the power of nature</strong>\u2014causing mushrooms, totems, and creatures to rise up and protect the egg when placed on them. Its power is unstable\u2014how you harness it will define your survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/49417e639511b04f703d46fdb44e3314.avif?t=1756554999\" width=616 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/6a438eb28615621bd4bf9c8a0232ae0c.poster.avif?t=1756554999\" width=1170 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/6a438eb28615621bd4bf9c8a0232ae0c.webm?t=1756554999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/6a438eb28615621bd4bf9c8a0232ae0c.mp4?t=1756554999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Omnicore &amp; Turrets :\u00a0</strong>Deploy and modify nature\u2019s guardians to shift the tide of battle.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Unique Playable Characters :\u00a0</strong>Each with their own weapons and abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Skills &amp; Items :\u00a0</strong>Stack absurd builds, experiment with upgrades, and break the game in the best way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Replayability</strong>\u00a0: Every run brings new enemies, challenges, and surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Online Co-op</strong>\u00a0: Team up with a friend and fight through the chaos together.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/fadf232072ea8eb7e338e8b5030a4ca0.avif?t=1756554999\" width=616 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/99226ac4ac2999b1b9f20f8d990a61c1.poster.avif?t=1756554999\" width=1170 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/99226ac4ac2999b1b9f20f8d990a61c1.webm?t=1756554999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/99226ac4ac2999b1b9f20f8d990a61c1.mp4?t=1756554999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join our Discord</strong>\u00a0Share feedback, get updates, and be part of the development. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Found a bug?</strong>\u00a0Press <strong>F8 in game</strong> to report issues and help improve the experience.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2985450?t=1756554999","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstati